# Design notes that are local scratch rather than shared documentation.
/docs/blob-storage-plan.md
/docs/profiling-catalog-qualification-fix.md

# Local dev-only evaluation tooling and admin UI state.
dev_tools/evaluation/
dev_tools/pgadmin/

# Upstream exclusion kept as-is: needs a live PostgreSQL it doesn't own.
auto_ontology/tests/test_postgres_connector.py
